<title>NETHERLANDS: VENDEX DETAILS H1 OPERATING PROFITS.</title>
<headline>VENDEX DETAILS H1 OPERATING PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail and business services</p>
<p>group Vendex International NV gave the following breakdown of</p>
<p>its sales and operating profits for the first half of 1996/97</p>
<p>(all figures in millions of guilders):</p>
<p>			     Sales	    Op profit	Real Estate</p>
<p>Food		  2,326 vs 2,272	53 vs  51	    2 vs  4</p>
<p>Department stores   741 vs   740	20 vs   3	   31 vs 16</p>
<p>Specialty stores    766 vs   715	29 vs  27	    8 vs 18</p>
<p>TOTAL RETAIL	3,833 vs 3,727     102 vs  81	   41 vs 38</p>
<p>Maintenance	   671 vs   569	14 vs  14	   -- vs --</p>
<p>Temporary work    1,047 vs   903	28 vs  27	   -- vs  1</p>
<p>Miscellaneous	 106 vs    98	 8 vs   9	   -- vs --</p>
<p>TOTAL SERVICES    1,824 vs 1,570	50 vs  50	   -- vs  1</p>
<p>OTHER ACTIVITIES     39 vs    54	 1 vs   2 loss     6 vs  3</p>
<p>OVERALL TOTAL     5,696 vs 5,351     153 vs 129	   47 vs 42</p>
<p>NOTES - Real estate column shows contribution to operating</p>
<p>profit made by sale and redevelopment of real estate.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
